.mcp.json

# Generated by AGENTS.md <-> CLAUDE.md sync hook
.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Local pack output from `dotnet pack -o artifacts/packages`.
# Real release builds are cut from a v*.*.* tag.
artifacts/

# roam deploy state (sync manifests + run summaries)
.roam/

# Agent and AI tooling. All of it is local configuration for whatever assistant a
# contributor happens to use, and none of it describes this tool. Ignored as a
# category rather than file by file, so a new tool's dotfile does not land in a
# commit before anyone notices it.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.gsd/
.mcp.json

# Repowise codebase index. Machine-local, regenerable, and large.
.repowise/
